function Assert-AbsolutePath { param([string]$Value,[string]$Name) if([string]::IsNullOrWhiteSpace($Value)){throw ("{0} is empty." -f $Name)} if(-not [IO.Path]::IsPathFullyQualified($Value)){throw ("{0} must be absolute." -f $Name)} }
function Relative-Path { param([string]$Base,[string]$Full) return [IO.Path]::GetRelativePath([IO.Path]::GetFullPath($Base),[IO.Path]::GetFullPath($Full)) }
function Split-CsvLine { param([string]$Line,[string]$Delimiter) $fields=New-Object System.Collections.Generic.List[string];$sb=New-Object System.Text.StringBuilder;$q=$false;$i=0;$len=$Line.Length;while($i -lt $len){$ch=$Line[$i];if($q){if($ch -eq '"'){if($i+1 -lt $len -and $Line[$i+1] -eq '"'){[void]$sb.Append('"');$i+=2;continue};$q=$false;$i++;continue};[void]$sb.Append($ch);$i++;continue};if($ch -eq '"'){$q=$true;$i++;continue};if($ch -eq $Delimiter){[void]$fields.Add($sb.ToString());$sb=New-Object System.Text.StringBuilder;$i++;continue};[void]$sb.Append($ch);$i++};[void]$fields.Add($sb.ToString());return ,$fields.ToArray() }
function Read-SampleRecords { param([string]$Path,[int]$MaxLines=50) $records=New-Object System.Collections.Generic.List[string];$pending=$null;$reader=[IO.File]::OpenText($Path);try{while($records.Count -lt $MaxLines){$line=$reader.ReadLine();if($null -eq $line){break};if($null -eq $pending){$pending=$line}else{$pending=$pending+"`n"+$line};if((([regex]::Matches($pending,'"')).Count % 2) -eq 0){[void]$records.Add($pending);$pending=$null}}}finally{$reader.Dispose()};if($null -ne $pending){[void]$records.Add($pending)};return ,$records.ToArray() }
# Robust, quote-aware, multi-line delimiter detector. Replaces the former fragile single-line
# 'Delimiter' (Get-Content -TotalCount 1) that miscounted delimiters inside quoted fields.
# Samples up to -MaxLines logical records (joining records split by an unterminated quoted field),
# scores each candidate (COMMA/SEMICOLON/TAB/PIPE) by field-count consistency, rejects single-field
# modes, and returns the raw delimiter character ("`t" for TAB) so Metadata/RowCompare are unchanged.
function Delimiter { param([string]$Path,[int]$MaxLines=50) $records=@(Read-SampleRecords -Path $Path -MaxLines $MaxLines|Where-Object{-not [string]::IsNullOrWhiteSpace($_)});if($records.Count -eq 0){return ","};$best=$null;foreach($cand in @(",",";","`t","|")){$counts=@($records|ForEach-Object{(Split-CsvLine $_ $cand).Count});$groups=@($counts|Group-Object|Sort-Object Count -Descending);$modeCount=[int]$groups[0].Name;$modeFreq=[int]$groups[0].Count;$consistency=$modeFreq/[double]$records.Count;if($modeCount -le 1){continue};$score=[pscustomobject]@{Delimiter=$cand;FieldCount=$modeCount;Consistency=$consistency};if($null -eq $best){$best=$score;continue};if($score.Consistency -gt $best.Consistency -or ($score.Consistency -eq $best.Consistency -and $score.FieldCount -gt $best.FieldCount)){$best=$score}};if($null -eq $best){return ","};return $best.Delimiter }
function Normalize-LogicalKey {
    param(
        [string]$LogicalKey,
        [string]$BaselineId,
        [string]$CandidateId
    )
    if ([string]::IsNullOrWhiteSpace($LogicalKey)) { return $LogicalKey }
    $normalized = $LogicalKey
    foreach ($id in @($BaselineId,$CandidateId)) {
        if (-not [string]::IsNullOrWhiteSpace($id)) {
            $escaped = [regex]::Escape($id)
            $normalized = $normalized -replace $escaped,"EXPORT"
        }
    }
    $normalized = $normalized -replace 'Exports_\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}',"EXPORT"
    $normalized = $normalized -replace 'EXPORT_EXPORT',"EXPORT"
    return $normalized
}
function Metadata { param([IO.FileInfo]$File,[string]$Root,[string]$ExportId) if($null -eq $File){throw "Metadata received a null file."};$d=Delimiter $File.FullName;$h=Get-Content -LiteralPath $File.FullName -TotalCount 1;$cols=@($h.Split($d)|ForEach-Object{$_.Trim().Trim('"')});$reader=[IO.StreamReader]::new($File.FullName);$n=0L;try{while($null -ne $reader.ReadLine()){$n++}}finally{$reader.Dispose()};return [pscustomobject]@{ExportId=$ExportId;LogicalKey=(Relative-Path $Root $File.FullName);Name=$File.Name;FullName=$File.FullName;Rows=if($n -gt 0){$n-1}else{0};Length=$File.Length;Delimiter=if($d -eq "`t"){"TAB"}else{$d};Columns=($cols -join "|");ColumnCount=$cols.Count;SHA256=(Get-FileHash -LiteralPath $File.FullName -Algorithm SHA256).Hash.ToUpperInvariant()} }
function KeyColumns { param([string[]]$Columns) foreach($set in @(@("HOLE_ID","FROM","TO"),@("HOLEID","FROM","TO"),@("HOLE_ID","FROM_M","TO_M"),@("UWI","FROM","TO"))){if(@($set|Where-Object{$_ -in $Columns}).Count -eq $set.Count){return @($set)}};return @() }
function Metrics { param([string[]]$Columns) return @(@("GT20_MEAN","GT30_MEAN","GT50_MEAN","ABX1_PROB","ABX2_PROB","QFP1_PROB","QFP2_PROB","BRXH_PROB","IND_PROB","SAMPLE_COVERAGE_RATIO")|Where-Object{$_ -in $Columns}) }
function Number { param([object]$Value) if($null -eq $Value -or [string]::IsNullOrWhiteSpace([string]$Value)){return $null};$n=0.0;$style=[Globalization.NumberStyles]::Float -bor [Globalization.NumberStyles]::AllowThousands;if([double]::TryParse([string]$Value,$style,[Globalization.CultureInfo]::InvariantCulture,[ref]$n)){return $n};if([double]::TryParse([string]$Value,$style,[Globalization.CultureInfo]::CurrentCulture,[ref]$n)){return $n};return $null }
function RowCompare { param([string]$BaselinePath,[string]$CandidatePath,[double]$Tolerance,[string]$LogicalKey) $bd=Delimiter $BaselinePath;$cd=Delimiter $CandidatePath;$b=@(Import-Csv -LiteralPath $BaselinePath -Delimiter $bd);$c=@(Import-Csv -LiteralPath $CandidatePath -Delimiter $cd);if($b.Count -eq 0 -or $c.Count -eq 0){return [pscustomobject]@{LogicalKey=$LogicalKey;Status="REVIEW_REQUIRED";BaselineRows=$b.Count;CandidateRows=$c.Count;KeyColumns="";Metrics="";CommonKeys=0;MissingKeys=0;UnexpectedKeys=0;NullMismatches=0;ValuesAboveTolerance=0;MaxAbsDifference=$null;Note="One or both files contain no data rows."}};$bc=@($b[0].PSObject.Properties.Name);$cc=@($c[0].PSObject.Properties.Name);if(($bc -join "|") -cne ($cc -join "|")){return [pscustomobject]@{LogicalKey=$LogicalKey;Status="NO_GO";BaselineRows=$b.Count;CandidateRows=$c.Count;KeyColumns="";Metrics="";CommonKeys=0;MissingKeys=0;UnexpectedKeys=0;NullMismatches=0;ValuesAboveTolerance=0;MaxAbsDifference=$null;Note="Schema mismatch."}};$keys=@(KeyColumns $bc);if($keys.Count -eq 0){return [pscustomobject]@{LogicalKey=$LogicalKey;Status="INVENTORY_ONLY";BaselineRows=$b.Count;CandidateRows=$c.Count;KeyColumns="";Metrics="";CommonKeys=0;MissingKeys=0;UnexpectedKeys=0;NullMismatches=0;ValuesAboveTolerance=0;MaxAbsDifference=$null;Note="No governed interval key detected."}};$metrics=@(Metrics $bc);$bm=@{};foreach($r in $b){$k=@($keys|ForEach-Object{[string]$r.$_}) -join "|";if($bm.ContainsKey($k)){throw ("Duplicate baseline key: {0}" -f $k)};$bm[$k]=$r};$cm=@{};foreach($r in $c){$k=@($keys|ForEach-Object{[string]$r.$_}) -join "|";if($cm.ContainsKey($k)){throw ("Duplicate candidate key: {0}" -f $k)};$cm[$k]=$r};$bk=@($bm.Keys);$ck=@($cm.Keys);$missing=@($bk|Where-Object{-not $cm.ContainsKey($_)});$unexpected=@($ck|Where-Object{-not $bm.ContainsKey($_)});$common=@($bk|Where-Object{$cm.ContainsKey($_)});$nullMismatch=0;$above=0;$max=0.0;foreach($k in $common){foreach($m in $metrics){$a=Number $bm[$k].$m;$x=Number $cm[$k].$m;if(($null -eq $a) -xor ($null -eq $x)){$nullMismatch++;continue};if($null -eq $a){continue};$diff=[math]::Abs($x-$a);if($diff -gt $max){$max=$diff};if($diff -gt $Tolerance){$above++}}};$status=if($missing.Count -or $unexpected.Count -or $nullMismatch -or $above){"REVIEW_REQUIRED"}else{"PASS"};return [pscustomobject]@{LogicalKey=$LogicalKey;Status=$status;BaselineRows=$b.Count;CandidateRows=$c.Count;KeyColumns=($keys -join "+");Metrics=($metrics -join "|");CommonKeys=$common.Count;MissingKeys=$missing.Count;UnexpectedKeys=$unexpected.Count;NullMismatches=$nullMismatch;ValuesAboveTolerance=$above;MaxAbsDifference=[math]::Round($max,12);Note="Row comparison completed."} }
Assert-AbsolutePath $ProcessedRoot "ProcessedRoot";if($AbsoluteTolerance -lt 0){throw "AbsoluteTolerance must be non-negative."};$pipelineRoot=Join-Path $ProcessedRoot $PipelineRunId;$baselineRoot=Join-Path $pipelineRoot $BaselineExportId;$candidateRoot=Join-Path $pipelineRoot $CandidateExportId;foreach($p in @($pipelineRoot,$baselineRoot,$candidateRoot)){if(-not(Test-Path -LiteralPath $p -PathType Container)){throw ("Required folder not found: {0}" -f $p)}};$output=Join-Path $pipelineRoot ("12_Cross_Export_Comparison\{0}" -f $RunId)
$baselineFiles=@(Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $baselineRoot -File -Recurse -Force|Where-Object{$_.Extension -ieq ".csv" -and $_.FullName -match "06_Consolidated_Database|07_Composites"}|Sort-Object FullName);$candidateFiles=@(Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $candidateRoot -File -Recurse -Force|Where-Object{$_.Extension -ieq ".csv" -and $_.FullName -match "06_Consolidated_Database|07_Composites"}|Sort-Object FullName);if($baselineFiles.Count -eq 0 -or $candidateFiles.Count -eq 0){throw "Comparable CSV files were not found."}
$baseInventory=@();foreach($f in $baselineFiles){$baseInventory+=Metadata $f $baselineRoot $BaselineExportId};$candidateInventory=@();foreach($f in $candidateFiles){$candidateInventory+=Metadata $f $candidateRoot $CandidateExportId}
$baseMap=@{};foreach($x in $baseInventory){$normalizedKey=Normalize-LogicalKey -LogicalKey $x.LogicalKey -BaselineId $BaselineExportId -CandidateId $CandidateExportId;if($baseMap.ContainsKey($normalizedKey)){throw ("Duplicate normalized baseline key: {0}" -f $normalizedKey)};$baseMap[$normalizedKey]=$x};$candidateMap=@{};foreach($x in $candidateInventory){$normalizedKey=Normalize-LogicalKey -LogicalKey $x.LogicalKey -BaselineId $BaselineExportId -CandidateId $CandidateExportId;if($candidateMap.ContainsKey($normalizedKey)){throw ("Duplicate normalized candidate key: {0}" -f $normalizedKey)};$candidateMap[$normalizedKey]=$x};$keys=@($baseMap.Keys+$candidateMap.Keys|Sort-Object -Unique)
$pairs=@();foreach($k in $keys){$hasB=$baseMap.ContainsKey($k);$hasC=$candidateMap.ContainsKey($k);$status=if($hasB -and $hasC){"PAIRED"}elseif($hasB){"BASELINE_ONLY"}else{"CANDIDATE_ONLY"};$pairs+=[pscustomobject]@{NormalizedLogicalKey=$k;BaselineLogicalKey=if($hasB){$baseMap[$k].LogicalKey}else{$null};CandidateLogicalKey=if($hasC){$candidateMap[$k].LogicalKey}else{$null};PairStatus=$status;BaselinePath=if($hasB){$baseMap[$k].FullName}else{$null};CandidatePath=if($hasC){$candidateMap[$k].FullName}else{$null}}}
$paired=@($pairs|Where-Object{$_.PairStatus -eq "PAIRED"});$fileLevel=@();$rowLevel=@();foreach($pair in $paired){$b=$baseMap[$pair.NormalizedLogicalKey];$c=$candidateMap[$pair.NormalizedLogicalKey];$fileLevel+=[pscustomobject]@{LogicalKey=$pair.NormalizedLogicalKey;BaselineRows=$b.Rows;CandidateRows=$c.Rows;RowDelta=$c.Rows-$b.Rows;SchemaMatch=($b.Columns -ceq $c.Columns);SHA256Match=($b.SHA256 -eq $c.SHA256);BaselineSHA256=$b.SHA256;CandidateSHA256=$c.SHA256};try{$rowLevel+=RowCompare $pair.BaselinePath $pair.CandidatePath $AbsoluteTolerance $pair.NormalizedLogicalKey}catch{if(-not $ContinueOnNonCriticalError){throw};$rowLevel+=[pscustomobject]@{LogicalKey=$pair.NormalizedLogicalKey;Status="REVIEW_REQUIRED";BaselineRows=$b.Rows;CandidateRows=$c.Rows;KeyColumns="";Metrics="";CommonKeys=0;MissingKeys=0;UnexpectedKeys=0;NullMismatches=0;ValuesAboveTolerance=0;MaxAbsDifference=$null;Note=$_.Exception.Message}}};$exceptions=@($pairs|Where-Object{$_.PairStatus -ne "PAIRED"});$review=@($rowLevel|Where-Object{$_.Status -in @("NO_GO","REVIEW_REQUIRED")});$criticalRowResults=@($rowLevel|Where-Object{$_.Status -eq "NO_GO"});$decisionReason="All normalized file pairs and row-level checks passed.";$decision=if($paired.Count -eq 0){$decisionReason="No normalized file pairs were produced.";"NO_GO"}elseif($criticalRowResults.Count -gt 0){$decisionReason="One or more paired files have a critical schema failure.";"NO_GO"}elseif($exceptions.Count -gt 0 -or $review.Count -gt 0){$decisionReason="Comparison completed with pairing or row-level findings requiring review.";"REVIEW_REQUIRED"}else{"PASS"};$workload=if(($baselineFiles.Count+$candidateFiles.Count) -le 20){"SMALL"}elseif(($baselineFiles.Count+$candidateFiles.Count) -le 100){"MEDIUM"}else{"LARGE"};$summary=[ordered]@{Classification=$Classification;Version=$Version;RunId=$RunId;PipelineRunId=$PipelineRunId;BaselineExportId=$BaselineExportId;CandidateExportId=$CandidateExportId;AbsoluteTolerance=$AbsoluteTolerance;BaselineFiles=$baselineFiles.Count;CandidateFiles=$candidateFiles.Count;PairedFiles=$paired.Count;PairingExceptions=$exceptions.Count;ReviewResults=$review.Count;WorkloadClass=$workload;Decision=$decision;DecisionReason=$decisionReason;CompletedAt=(Get-Date).ToString("o")}
Write-Host "";Write-Host ("{0} | CROSS-EXPORT COMPARISON v{1}" -f $Classification,$Version) -ForegroundColor Cyan;Write-Host ("PIPELINE ROOT: {0}" -f $pipelineRoot);Write-Host ("BASELINE: {0}" -f $baselineRoot);Write-Host ("CANDIDATE: {0}" -f $candidateRoot);Write-Host ("PROPOSED OUTPUT: {0}" -f $output);Write-Host ("WORKLOAD: {0}" -f $workload);$pairs|Format-Table NormalizedLogicalKey,PairStatus -AutoSize;$rowLevel|Format-Table LogicalKey,Status,BaselineRows,CandidateRows,MissingKeys,UnexpectedKeys,ValuesAboveTolerance -AutoSize;Write-Host ("DECISION: {0}" -f $decision)
if($AuditOnly){Write-Host "AUDITONLY PASS: NO FILES OR FOLDERS CREATED." -ForegroundColor Green;exit 0}
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $output -ErrorAction Stop|Out-Null;$baseInventory|Export-Csv (Join-Path $output "Baseline_Inventory.csv") -NoTypeInformation -Encoding utf8;$candidateInventory|Export-Csv (Join-Path $output "Candidate_Inventory.csv") -NoTypeInformation -Encoding utf8;$pairs|Export-Csv (Join-Path $output "File_Pair_Register.csv") -NoTypeInformation -Encoding utf8;$fileLevel|Export-Csv (Join-Path $output "File_Level_Comparison.csv") -NoTypeInformation -Encoding utf8;$rowLevel|Export-Csv (Join-Path $output "Row_Level_Comparison.csv") -NoTypeInformation -Encoding utf8;$summary|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10|Set-Content (Join-Path $output "Comparison_Summary.json") -Encoding utf8;@([pscustomobject]$summary)|Export-Csv (Join-Path $output "Comparison_Summary.csv") -NoTypeInformation -Encoding utf8;$files=@(Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $output -File);$manifest=[ordered]@{Classification=$Classification;Version=$Version;RunId=$RunId;Decision=$decision;Files=@()};foreach($f in $files){$manifest.Files+=[ordered]@{Name=$f.Name;Length=$f.Length;SHA256=(Get-FileHash $f.FullName -Algorithm SHA256).Hash}};$manifest|ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10|Set-Content (Join-Path $output "Manifest.json") -Encoding utf8;$lines=@();foreach($f in @(Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $output -File|Sort-Object Name)){$lines+=("{0}  {1}" -f (Get-FileHash $f.FullName -Algorithm SHA256).Hash,$f.Name)};$lines|Set-Content (Join-Path $output "SHA256SUMS.txt") -Encoding ascii;Write-Host ("REPORT ROOT: {0}" -f $output) -ForegroundColor Green;Write-Host "CROSS-EXPORT COMPARISON COMPLETE" -ForegroundColor Green
